kerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1583031147,"text":"でも狼といえば、最近気になることがあってね。","nextNodeIds":[4520118]},{"nodeId":4520118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":1584396043,"text":"いつもは「奔狼領」で過ごす狼の群れが、最近やけに活発になってるみたいなの。","nextNodeIds":[4520119]},{"nodeId":4520119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":4049365723,"text":"「酔漢峡」付近のキャラバンを襲ったって話も聞いたし…","nextNodeIds":[4520120]},{"nodeId":4520120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":2534718875,"text":"だから、時間があったら調査を手伝って欲しいんだけど、いいかな？","nextNodeIds":[4520121,4520122]},{"nodeId":4520121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3869425203,"text":"分かった。","nextNodeIds":[4520123]},{"nodeId":4520123,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":2012216883,"text":"ふふっ、頼もしいね。じゃあ、出発しよう！","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":4520122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":722034859,"text":"そっちの方が一大事だ。","nextNodeIds":[4520123]},{"nodeId":4520124,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":1089655491,"text":"調子はどう？","nextNodeIds":[4520125]},{"nodeId":4520125,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3207786555,"text":"あっ、暇してそうだね。","nextNodeIds":[4520126]},{"nodeId":4520126,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1014590867,"text":"げっ、この言葉の後はだいたい——","nextNodeIds":[4520127]},{"nodeId":4520127,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1002,"speakerName":"アンバー","textMapHash":3409290291,"text":"こっちは最近、忙しいんだ。なんたって偵察騎士の責任は重大だからね——もちろん、手伝ってくれるよね？","nextNodeIds":[4520129]},{"nodeId":4520129,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":1005,"speakerName":"パイモン","textMapHash":1898783275,"text":"やっぱり！","nextNodeIds":[4520130,4520131]},{"nodeId":4520130,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人",